smd: 2
title: Overflow
---

:::agent
Keep answers short AGENT-TOP.
:::

## Rules

:::constraint{#CD scope=document}
Every payment call carries an idempotency key, and a retry reuses the key of the first attempt so that a timeout never charges a card twice RULE-BODY.
:::

## Work

:::requirement{#R1}
Charge the card once the fraud check passes, and store the processor reference with the order WORK-BODY.
:::

